  "description": "When Hong Yeonhwa regains consciousness, she finds herself trapped in an underground storage room. Yeonhwa suffers several horrific deaths at the hands of the man who imprisoned her, but time keeps repeating itself again and again. After barely managing to escape that place, what she finds waiting before her is a terrifying-looking monster. Will Yeonhwa be able to keep moving forward in the face of endless death…?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852086), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14366954)",
